	(property "Description" "The ball seat of ErgoCai.modules trackball/PMW3610, the trackball on the keyboard board itself (cup.js --fix screws --style seat --support 2 --ball 20, 3D printed, after htx-studio's One-Handed Keyboard seat): a plinth with four lobes, each a boss with an M2 heat-set insert screwed from under the board (TB_H1..TB_H4), and a shell that follows the ball; three 2 mm balls set half into the wall carry it, three more in vertical holes in three lugs over the equator hold it down. Its Dwgs.User square is the case cut-out over it, round the lugs and the bosses (grown by 1.5 mm by the case); no courtyard, as it sits over its own screw holes. No copper, nothing in the BOM. Origin on the ball's axis, the sensor's optical centre; the model is cup.js --step, with the 20 mm ball and the six small ones, for the lens's reference plane 4.35 mm over a 1.6 mm board."
		(at 0 0 0)
